# AI Assisted Commit Message Template
#  Copy this file to the working folder within the project
#  to compose a commit message for each set of changes
#  Setup as repo commit template: `git config commit.template .gitmessage`

# Short description of commit
<type>(scope): <short description>

# Multi-lined detailed description of changes
<detailed description>

# Attribution for transparancy
AI-assisted: [yes/no]
AI-model: [which AI(s) used, e.g., Grok / Claude] # only if AI-assisted is yes
AI-location: [local/cloud] # only if AI-assisted is yes

# References: #issue or PR number